## Verdict

`PASS`.

V4b resolves the previous V4 reprojection blocker by removing runtime scalar gating from the reprojection smoke. The passing control path is:

1. `User.V4B_DeltaControls` Position Array -> `Module.DeltaControls` -> Custom HLSL input.
2. `User.V4B_SeedControls` Position Array -> `Module.SeedControls` -> Custom HLSL input.
3. `SeedControls.Length() > 0` stamps the initial marker.
4. Runtime push changes `SeedControls` from count `1` to count `0`.
5. `DeltaControls[0].xy / 256` drives `SamplePreviousGrid(Unit - DeltaUV)`.

